tutorial.intro.title=How to Play
tutorial.intro.body=Learn matching, combos, and special tiles on a practice board.\nThen you will start a real match with the timer.
tutorial.step_counter=Step {0} of {1}

tutorial.step.match3.title=Match 3
tutorial.step.match3.instruction=Tap tile 1, then tile 2 to swap. Make a line of 3 matching colors.

tutorial.step.match4.title=Match 4+
tutorial.step.match4.instruction=Tap tile 1, then tile 2. Longer lines score more.

tutorial.step.joker.title=Joker
tutorial.step.joker.instruction=Tap tile 1, then tile 2. Joker counts as any color already in that line.

tutorial.step.bomb.title=Bomb Joker
tutorial.step.bomb.instruction=When matched, the Bomb clears its whole row and column. Chain with other bombs.

tutorial.step.skull.title=Skull
tutorial.step.skull.instruction=Clearing skulls removes time from the clock. Avoid them when you can!
